abstract: >-
  The Area 51 research line of Cerebral Graphix: the 51 SEDAPS reversible card rule and its
  turn-indexed reachability certificates, the 51 Twins exhibit and its Davenport-Heilbronn
  calibration, the Formula 51 deduction, and the TN Postmaster Volume I v5.2 source edition,
  with independent replays, complete state censuses, a proof that the reachability search is
  complete, exact first failing Loewner sizes for the twin, and a re-execution of the inherited
  v5.0 source-rung certificates. RH status: open.
keywords:
  - card games
  - War (card game)
  - reachability
  - certificates
  - Widder criterion
  - Davenport-Heilbronn function
  - experimental mathematics
